    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>先决条件：</strong> 浆人</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><p>只要你没有携带或穿着任何东西，你就能跻身通过至多只有1寸宽的空间。你为发起或逃脱擒抱所进行的属性检定具有优势。</p></div><p>You can squeeze through a space as narrow as 1 inch wide, provided you are wearing and carrying nothing. You have advantage on ability checks you make to initiate or escape a grapple.</p>",
